docs {
  ## GET /api/vton/cache

  Checks whether a cached VTON result exists for a given session ID.
  Returns the cached image URL if available, enabling fast re-renders
  without re-running the diffusion model.

  ### Query Parameters
  | Param     | Type   | Required | Description                          |
  |-----------|--------|----------|--------------------------------------|
  | sessionId | string | ✅       | Session ID previously used in VTON   |

  ### Cache Hit (200)
  ```json
  {
    "cached": true,
    "imageUrl": "https://cdn.manikan.io/vton/sess_abc123.jpg",
    "expiresAt": "2026-08-30T00:00:00Z"
  }
  ```

  ### Cache Miss (200)
  ```json
  { "cached": false }
  ```
}
